    (:tests "fans-oppai: nbb 87 tests / 1181 assertions (was 69 / 389); bot_test pins boundary, determinism, placement, quality floors with their boundary cases. murakumo: fleet one_model + topology 26 tests / 73 assertions on a JVM mirror (was 22 / 61; the repo's own JVM entry cannot load .cljk today). verify-one-model-per-node: 12 nodes ok, discriminated both ways (undefined checkpoint -> exit 1, unknown plane -> exit 1).")
